{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"plays a few mournful notes on the flute \"Lovely Lady Baeshra, The fiercest in the land, has used her words of wisdom, to aid in her people's time of greatest need.\" the tune lifts up on the next few notes played \"She has wrestled a manticore and defeated devils with ease and grace.\" The next few notes are a bit slower \"She had made peace with a fierce snake-cat that could speak into your mind.\" the next few notes play like a slowing heart, until a moment of silence \"but alas, she died, her story cut short\" and then the beating notes start again \"Only to have bested death itself in the game of life, and found happiness in the web of her new devotion.\"","created_at":"2020-08-16T03:05:35.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744391382449389578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"709304697713852446","content":"Baeshra's head bobs along with the tune but her face is contorted in confusion as the twists of facts.","created_at":"2020-08-16T03:07:47.173000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"744391933891444806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
